		"description": "<p>Whenever you Safe Rest, choose one:</p><ul><li><strong>Weaponsmith.</strong> Your weapons gain +STR damage until your next Safe Rest.</li><li><strong>Armorsmith.</strong> Your armor gains +STR Armor until your next Safe Rest.</li></ul><hr><p>[A] Click the action to pick Weaponsmith or Armorsmith. The choice is recorded on your sheet (<code>flags.nim-plus-package.journeymanChoice</code>) and cleared on your next Safe Rest. With Masterwork (L11) the bonus is <strong>STR + WIL</strong> and you may take both.</p><p>[M] Add the damage or Armor bonus by hand.</p>",
